        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF146 adds support for using non-registered symbols as keys for WeakMap and WeakSet in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1966745\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1966745</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds a release note.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3607691670\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41868\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41868/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41868\">#41868</a></p>",
