        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>create new page for <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;timeline-range-name&gt;</code></li>\n<li>rewrite <code class=\"notranslate\">animation-range</code> shorthand property.</li>\n<li>make example detail how the property works and interacts with afm</li>\n</ul>",
